  "custom_logic_notes": "EA uses trend filter via 50 EMA - long entries only above 50 EMA, short entries only below 50 EMA. RSI used as confirmation filter: long requires RSI above 50 or below overbought threshold, short requires RSI below 50 or above oversold threshold. Babi Ngepet is Indonesian folklore referencing a magical boar that brings wealth, suggesting this EA is designed for aggressive trend-following with mean-reversion filters. The digit adjustment pattern multiplies SL/TP by 10 for 5-digit brokers, storing adjusted values in adjustedSL and adjustedTP variables. ADX may be used as a trend strength filter to avoid entries in ranging markets.",
